 "is_free": false,
 "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/9628e28fae11abed4733dccb0dd3ff43.poster.avif?t=1788242136\" width=718 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/9628e28fae11abed4733dccb0dd3ff43.webm?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/9628e28fae11abed4733dccb0dd3ff43.mp4?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flat in shadow. Tall in light.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shine to raise. Absorb to flatten.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person puzzler for the people who still keep a portal gun, a camera, and a perspective shift bookmarked in their library.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/7873e13af49c479247349358b6323e90.poster.avif?t=1788242136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/7873e13af49c479247349358b6323e90.webm?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/7873e13af49c479247349358b6323e90.mp4?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/86ebdce893df1989576874decc7910dd.poster.avif?t=1788242136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/86ebdce893df1989576874decc7910dd.webm?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/86ebdce893df1989576874decc7910dd.mp4?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shine light to give shadow weight.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A flat square unfolds into a staircase. A fragile outline turns into a towering pillar. Light grants mass, collision, gravity — and once it's solid, you climb it, push it, drop it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/cafc526eb4bd16520ea210a352f22001.poster.avif?t=1788242136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/cafc526eb4bd16520ea210a352f22001.webm?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/cafc526eb4bd16520ea210a352f22001.mp4?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Absorb light to switch Physics off.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rolling ball lies still. A wall becomes a doorway. Mass vanishes — and what blocked you now lets you through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/2b33a08ea37dacc82f040df317d63c1e.poster.avif?t=1788242136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/2b33a08ea37dacc82f040df317d63c1e.webm?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/2b33a08ea37dacc82f040df317d63c1e.mp4?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The mechanic keeps growing.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mirrors duplicate. Lenses resize. Merging fuses two forms into a new one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three chapters deep. Five mechanics that learn to talk to each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more the rules combine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built to escalate — never just adding, always recombining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 chapters · 6+ hours · 60+ Stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/396939ebf5ae59a81db850f07c6ca0c6.poster.avif?t=1788242136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/396939ebf5ae59a81db850f07c6ca0c6.webm?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/396939ebf5ae59a81db850f07c6ca0c6.mp4?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A world that watches you solve it.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unnamed Administrator built this place to be flawless. A marble museum gives way to an office that repeats one hallway too many times, and finally to a black-and-white space where memory leaks through the walls. The architecture is your second puzzle — read it carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for the beings hiding in the shadows...</p>",
 "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flat in shadow. Tall in light.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shine to raise. Absorb to flatten.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person puzzler for the people who still keep a portal gun, a camera, and a perspective shift bookmarked in their library.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/7873e13af49c479247349358b6323e90.poster.avif?t=1788242136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/7873e13af49c479247349358b6323e90.webm?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/7873e13af49c479247349358b6323e90.mp4?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/86ebdce893df1989576874decc7910dd.poster.avif?t=1788242136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/86ebdce893df1989576874decc7910dd.webm?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/86ebdce893df1989576874decc7910dd.mp4?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shine light to give shadow weight.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A flat square unfolds into a staircase. A fragile outline turns into a towering pillar. Light grants mass, collision, gravity — and once it's solid, you climb it, push it, drop it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/cafc526eb4bd16520ea210a352f22001.poster.avif?t=1788242136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/cafc526eb4bd16520ea210a352f22001.webm?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/cafc526eb4bd16520ea210a352f22001.mp4?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Absorb light to switch Physics off.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rolling ball lies still. A wall becomes a doorway. Mass vanishes — and what blocked you now lets you through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/2b33a08ea37dacc82f040df317d63c1e.poster.avif?t=1788242136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/2b33a08ea37dacc82f040df317d63c1e.webm?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/2b33a08ea37dacc82f040df317d63c1e.mp4?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The mechanic keeps growing.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mirrors duplicate. Lenses resize. Merging fuses two forms into a new one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three chapters deep. Five mechanics that learn to talk to each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more the rules combine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built to escalate — never just adding, always recombining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 chapters · 6+ hours · 60+ Stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/396939ebf5ae59a81db850f07c6ca0c6.poster.avif?t=1788242136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/396939ebf5ae59a81db850f07c6ca0c6.webm?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/396939ebf5ae59a81db850f07c6ca0c6.mp4?t=1788242136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A world that watches you solve it.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unnamed Administrator built this place to be flawless. A marble museum gives way to an office that repeats one hallway too many times, and finally to a black-and-white space where memory leaks through the walls. The architecture is your second puzzle — read it carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for the beings hiding in the shadows...</p>",
